  "nondeterminism_finding": "Previous overlay (image sha256:3104024d6bdf..., every crate instrumented) gave different maps for separate processes on the same control: 1881-1887 tuples, hit-count buckets differing in tuple IDs 7544-7561. The AFL++ runtime numbers guards from 5 (map size 89259 = 89254 guards + 5), so these are guard slots 7539-7556. Mapping each __sanitizer_cov_trace_pc_guard call site in that binary to its slot puts every one of them in symphonia_core::codecs::registry::InnerCodecRegistry<AudioCodecId, RegisteredAudioDecoder>::register_at_tier, monomorphized in the symphonia facade crate (symphonia-core 0.6.1 src/codecs/registry.rs:164: three std HashMap::insert calls whose probe loops depend on per-process random SipHash keys). This overlay leaves the facade, symphonia-core and all other crates uninstrumented.",
